{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw, Draw, Pass!</strong> is a chaotic co-op drawing game. The gameplay consists of 1 guesser while the rest of the players are artists. At the beginning of each round, a prompt is chosen and the group is tasked with collaborating their drawing skills for a comprehensive image. After the drawing rounds are completed, the guesser has a chance to guess the prompt. When the round completes, the next round will start and a new guesser will be assigned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394740/extras/5f4dc2cd4e6b3911d386da0677dab38c.avif?t=1772516506\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round begins with a random prompt. It might be cute, weird, chaotic\u2026 or something else entirely. Only the artists know what it is. The guesser? Completely in the dark. Get ready to turn a simple idea into absolute madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394740/extras/c53d290801771fb5dff11ada3b1afdab.avif?t=1772516506\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists take turns drawing <strong>one piece at a time</strong> before passing the drawing along. You\u2019ll have limited time and no do-overs \u2014 so make it count. Will you create a masterpiece\u2026 or sabotage your friends with beautiful nonsense?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394740/extras/afc6981efa3c9998fcf1d9290efdc7bf.avif?t=1772516506\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the drawing is complete, the guesser studies the chaos. Was that a dragon\u2026 or a vacuum cleaner? Make a guess. No pressure.\u00a0 If they\u2019re right, everyone wins. If not\u2026 well, better luck next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394740/extras/b22a75e2f4bdf98e94910c48df4d14b7.webp?t=1772516506\" width=1232 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a huge library of drawing prompts for free in <strong>Draw, Draw, Pass!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 1\u20138 players in either Creative Mode or Standard Mode with friends or random players in public lobbies. Collaborate, compete, and see what chaotic masterpiece you can create together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your avatar with tons of unique looks and accessories, jump into a lobby, and let the drawing madness begin!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Always Right","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394740/2c15c92522097bea10eb8d8a10ecc47322947946.jpg"},{"name":"The Scribbler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394740/46609a3e9b34ad6b25979973d03b8d300a54db05.jpg"},{"name":"Blank Canvas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394740/e0235b40b2d0adcf215281c88110520a5fbf520e.jpg"},{"name":"Trust the Process","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394740/4cec01f8ee75b612b98e949dee99d395a4c770f8.jpg"},{"name":"RGB Crew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394740/212c1af4ab076c2c3e9b14ab648d087e5ed43750.jpg"},{"name":"Paint Goblin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394740/0b9673d6573a711ac327f0ac49ae12eec05e3cc6.jpg"},{"name":"Little Brush","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394740/a44ead118327adbf088b033a